SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Nights! July18th 6-11:30pm at Laurel Hill Park in
  Secaucus
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Mikey/Michael.\nAvoid kicking\, don't use your head.\nFree t
 o play. We'll have 2 Pro Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson Pro ball.\nThe courts are
  open to the public and if they happen to be taken\, we may play with thos
 e already playing initially\, or we will move to the grass since we have a
  Volleyball NET!\nThey have a food truck there as well.\nIf it's looking l
 ike it'll rain\, I'll make a call on whether to cancel.\nThis is a non com
 petitive casual play and open to all levels.\nIf you have fun and would li
 ke to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Je
 rsey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)\n[V for
  Volleyball Summer Night Play! July18th 6-10pm at Laurel Hill Park in Seca
 ucus | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/events/1288638486581291?acontext
 =%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A%5B%7B%22surface%22%3A%22group%22%7D%5D%7
 D)\n[Volleyball Courts - Google Maps](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Vo
 lleyball+Courts/@40.7600226\,-74.0923928\,16.17z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1svoll
 eyball!3m6!1s0x89c257000a7a978f:0x8d79b81a213d5598!8m2!3d40.7601281!4d-74.
